    config: `spring_ai:\n  model_adapter: provider_neutral\n  output_schema: required\n  timeout_ms: 3000\n  retries: bounded\n  events: kafka\n  actions: policy_checked\n  audit: enabled`,
    code: `record AiDecision(String intent, boolean needsReview) {}\n\nAiDecision route(String request) {\n    boolean review = request.toLowerCase().contains("refund")\n        || request.toLowerCase().contains("delete");\n    return new AiDecision("support", review);\n}\n\nSystem.out.println(route("customer asks for a refund"));`,
